{"suttaId":"tha-ap257","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Ap-i","vriCode":"s0510m1.mul","paras":[8308,8317],"vripara":"17"},"segments":{"tha-ap257:0.3":"Sattapāṭaliyattheraapadānaṃ","tha-ap257:1.1":"“Kaṇikāraṃva jotantaṃ, nisinnaṃ pabbatantare;","tha-ap257:1.3":"Satta pāṭalipupphāni, buddhassa abhiropayiṃ.","tha-ap257:2.1":"“Catunnavutito kappe, yaṃ pupphamabhiropayiṃ;","tha-ap257:2.3":"Duggatiṃ nābhijānāmi, buddhapūjāyidaṃ phalaṃ.","tha-ap257:3.1":"“Paṭisambhidā catasso … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ”.","tha-ap257:4.1":"Itthaṃ sudaṃ āyasmā sattapāṭaliyo thero imā gāthāyo abhāsitthāti.","tha-ap257:5.1":"Sattapāṭaliyattherassāpadānaṃ pañcamaṃ."},"attha":null,"tika":null}
